<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>OldBirds - 个人简介</title>
    <link href="/third/bootstrap-5.3.6/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="/styles/custom.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="/styles/me.css" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100">
    <header class="navbar px-3 fixed-top">
        <span class="navbar-brand fw-bold fs-3">OldBirds</span>
        
        <a href="/page/posts" class="btn btn-primary ms-auto">前往博客系统</a>
    </header>
    <div class="container py-5" style="max-width: 900px;">
        <div class="text-center mb-5 fade-in">
            <img src="/imgs/oldbirds.png" alt="头像" class="rounded-circle avatar-animate" width="130" height="130">
            <h1 class="mt-4 mb-1 fw-bold">OldBirds</h1>
            <p class="text-muted fs-5">全栈开发者 | 技术布道者 | 奶爸一枚</p>
        </div>
        <div class="section-card fade-in delay-1">
            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">个人简介</h4>
            <p class="mb-0 fs-6">
                热爱技术与创新，专注于 Web、移动端和云原生开发。喜欢分享、乐于开源，致力于用代码改变世界。<br>
                目前专注于高效开发工具、极简产品和技术内容创作。
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="section-card fade-in delay-2">
            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">联系方式</h4>
            <ul class="list-unstyled fs-6 mb-0">
                <li class="mb-1">📧 邮箱：<a href="mailto:oheroj@email.com">oheroj@email.com</a></li>
                <li class="mb-1">💬 微信：oheroj</li>
                <li class="mb-1">🐙 GitHub：<a href="https://github.com/oheroj" target="_blank">oheroj</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="section-card fade-in delay-3">
            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">自媒体</h4>
            <ul class="list-unstyled fs-6 mb-0">
                <li class="mb-1">
                    掘金：<a href="https://juejin.cn/user/325111172054350" target="_blank">OldBirds</a>
                </li>
                <li class="mb-1">
                    <div class="mb-2">微信公众号：</div>
                    <div class="row g-4">
                        <div class="col-me-6">
                            <img src="/imgs/gzh-wechat-logo.png" alt="微信公众号" class="img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm" style="padding:8px;">
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-me-6"></div>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="section-card fade-in delay-4">
            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">我的产品</h4>
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="media-item h-100">
                        <img src="/imgs/idiray-cover.png" alt="iDiray Logo" class="media-logo">
                        <div>
                            <div class="fw-bold">iDiray</div>
                            <div class="text-muted small mb-1">基于 Git 存储的原子笔记 App</div>
                            <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=run.oldbird.idiary&pli=1" target="_blank" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary">前往</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="media-item h-100">
                        <img src="/imgs/panda-cover.png" alt="Panda Logo" class="media-logo">
                        <div>
                            <div class="fw-bold">Panda</div>
                            <div class="text-muted small mb-1">基于 TinyPNG 的图片压缩神器 App</div>
                            <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=run.oldbird.panda" target="_blank" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary">前往</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-card fade-in delay-4">
            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">我的课程</h4>
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="media-item h-100">
                        <img src="/imgs/vaporblog-cover.png" alt="VaporBlog 课程封面" class="media-cover">
                        <div>
                            <div class="fw-bold">VaporBlog</div>
                            <div class="text-muted small mb-1">基于 Vapor 的极简博客系统</div>
                            <a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MzI4MDM2MDAzOA==&action=getalbum&album_id=4011584829035593730&from_itemidx=1&from_msgid=2247486416#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary">《Swift Vapor 实战》</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- 可继续添加更多课程，按需复制 col-md-6 块 -->
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center text-muted pb-4 pt-2 small">
            <a href="https://beian.miit.gov.cn/" target="_blank" class="text-decoration-none">赣ICP备2021010021号-1</a>
            &nbsp;|&nbsp;
            <a href="http://www.beian.gov.cn/portal/registerSystemInfo?recordcode=36011102000528" target="_blank" class="text-decoration-none">
                <img src="/imgs/beian.avif" style="width:16px;height:16px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:2px;" alt="备案图标">
                赣公网安备 36011102000528号
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="/third/bootstrap-5.3.6/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>